<title>USA: AMT Industries Q2 March 31 net increases.</title>
<headline>AMT Industries Q2 March 31 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON, Texas 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>						 March 31,    March 31,</p>
<p>					   1997    1996    1997    1996</p>
<p>Consolidated Operating Data:</p>
<p> Revenues			    $6,802  $4,838 $13,058  $8,956</p>
<p> Net income			     513     356     919     557</p>
<p> Net income per share		0.04    0.03    0.06    0.04</p>
<p>Shares used to calculate</p>
<p>  net income per share	   14,078  12,568  14,438  12,454</p>
<p>		(IN THOUSANDS EXCEPT RATIOS AND PER SHARE DATA)</p>
<p>NOTE:  AMT Industries Inc said that during the three-month period ended March 31, 1997, warrants for the purchase of 2,095,975 shares of common stock were exercised pursuant to the Company's registration statement on Form S-3. At the same time, warrants representing approximately 719,000 shares expired unexercised, leaving approximately 2,703,000 warrants outstanding at the end of the period.</p>
</text>
